{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/1094897-resolving-human-anchors","id":1094897,"title":"Resolving human anchors","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Geist: The Sin-Eaters"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-05-20T11:24:08-07:00","id":1094897,"title":"Resolving human anchors","content":"In my story I am considering my Sin-Eaters encountering a ghost with a human anchor. If the anchor has to be resolved for the ghost to Pass On what is the best way to do that without having to kill the human anchor? I'm sure there is something in the book about this I just haven't seen it. Any help is appreciated.<br /> <br /> Thank you.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Nothing is foolproof for a sufficiently talented fool.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/981-bigwhitt","name":"bigwhitt","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar981_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"15"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-20T12:10:50-07:00","id":1094910,"title":"","content":"Usually, ghosts with human anchors tend to be attached to them because of some kind of unfinished business with relation to the anchor. The ghost of a mother, for example, might be anchored to her daughter by the desire to see her get into college. If you do that, the anchor's resolved.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=423\" data-tempid=\"temp_423_1523360155059_212\" />\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":